WEBVTT

00:01.270 --> 00:04.400
Too bad! You missed your chance.

00:04.710 --> 00:07.530
Ara-teen is mine now.

00:07.530 --> 00:12.070
Shorty, you little punk! 
You joined Siguma? Jeez.

00:12.070 --> 00:14.220
Ara-chan, what's going on?

00:15.120 --> 00:19.580
Hold on a minute. Ara-chan,
 we were gonna become Honki People...

00:19.580 --> 00:23.040
Like I said, he joined Siguma, man!

00:23.040 --> 00:26.260
If you want him, come and take him by force.

00:26.810 --> 00:29.030
Let's go, Ara-teen.

00:35.020 --> 00:40.490
Heave-ho, here we go! 
Siguma is on a roll! Bucchigiri!

00:46.460 --> 00:48.000
How much do you have now?

00:48.000 --> 00:49.360
A little over 20,000.

00:49.360 --> 00:50.810
That's bad!

00:50.810 --> 00:55.080
The Emperor knocked three teeth out 
of the last guy who didn't make quota.

00:55.080 --> 00:58.130
That Jin Marito guy is the head of Siguma,

00:58.130 --> 01:02.380
and he's trying to take on Doman Kenichiro, 
the old geezer in Minato Kai.

01:03.150 --> 01:07.420
Find a way to make them settle it? Hmm...

01:07.420 --> 01:10.610
That might be a good idea.

01:11.330 --> 01:14.500
Who's the Emperor talking to?

02:45.020 --> 02:55.530
<b>Ikki Union</b>

02:45.020 --> 02:55.530
<b>Minato Kai</b>

02:45.190 --> 02:50.650
<b>#03 Love at Fist Fight! The One and Only Quail in the World</b>

02:47.140 --> 02:49.070
Minato Kai and Ikki Union

02:49.070 --> 02:54.780
long fought the deadliest, most famous 
battle for the top here at Ichizu High.

02:55.530 --> 03:00.910
Then the 43rd leader of 
Minato Kai, Doman Kenichiro,

03:01.400 --> 03:04.540
buried Ikki Union's boss with one blow.

03:05.060 --> 03:08.110
Right when Ikki Union's 
fate appeared to be sealed,

03:09.230 --> 03:11.770
one man appeared before Doman.

03:12.150 --> 03:13.900
It was Jin Marito!

03:15.690 --> 03:16.570
<b>Ikki Union</b>

03:16.000 --> 03:20.790
With Jin now the head of Ikki Union, 
the gang rebranded itself as Siguma Squad

03:20.790 --> 03:23.980
and immediately regained its former glory!

03:24.640 --> 03:26.270
So right now,

03:26.270 --> 03:26.530
<b>Jin
Marito</b>

03:26.270 --> 03:28.200
<b>Doman Kenichiro</b>

03:26.270 --> 03:30.710
<b>Minato</b>

03:26.270 --> 03:33.780
<b>Ikki</b>

03:26.530 --> 03:28.200
<b>head</b>

03:26.590 --> 03:28.640
having wrestled our age-old 
enemy Minato to the ground,

03:28.640 --> 03:33.780
the time for Siguma to take 
the top is nearly upon us!

03:29.160 --> 03:29.580
<b>Jin
Marito</b>

03:29.160 --> 03:30.710
<b>Doman Kenichiro</b>

03:29.160 --> 03:33.780
<b>head</b>

03:30.290 --> 03:30.960
<b>Jin
Marito</b>

03:30.870 --> 03:33.780
<b>Minato</b>

03:30.940 --> 03:33.780
<b>Doman Kenichiro</b>

03:31.020 --> 03:33.780
<b>Jin
Marito</b>

03:35.510 --> 03:36.870
Now you're talking!

03:36.870 --> 03:39.900
Heave-ho, it's fight time! Bucchigiri!

03:40.630 --> 03:43.160
Hey, are you listening?

03:43.160 --> 03:45.660
Y-Yeah...

03:45.660 --> 03:49.110
<i>I joined Siguma for Mahoro-chan,</i>

03:49.110 --> 03:52.540
<i>and you think I'm gonna waste 
my youth fighting instead?</i>

03:53.300 --> 03:54.670
Ara-teen!

03:55.330 --> 03:56.920
We're going out!

03:57.520 --> 03:59.130
I would love to!

03:59.130 --> 04:03.150
Si-Si-Siguma's the strongest bunch!

04:03.150 --> 04:06.670
Our fights all end in victory!

04:06.670 --> 04:09.930
We'll kill you real good again today!

04:07.410 --> 04:09.930
Um, where are we going?

04:09.930 --> 04:14.020
We never run short of opponents to put down!

04:15.910 --> 04:18.920
Heyo, Outa. How's it looking?

04:19.570 --> 04:21.910
Yep, be there in a jiffy.

04:21.910 --> 04:24.910
Better not let this go to your head, punk.

04:25.260 --> 04:29.580
Sounds like everything is set. Let's-a go!

04:29.580 --> 04:30.870
But to where?

04:30.870 --> 04:33.170
Your welcoming party! Where else?

04:33.170 --> 04:37.420
We'll be spoiling you with debauchery, yo!

04:37.420 --> 04:40.940
D-Debauchery?!

04:40.970 --> 04:43.140
<b>Debauchery</b>

04:43.590 --> 04:49.640
<i>Aw, man. But I'm the type that can 
only share my heart with one girl.</i>

04:51.550 --> 04:53.040
Please! Stop!

04:53.040 --> 04:54.980
Shit! Only 1,000 yen?

04:54.980 --> 04:56.100
Huh?!

04:56.100 --> 04:57.650
We're screwed, man!

04:57.650 --> 04:58.780
How so?

04:58.780 --> 05:02.510
I told you, if we don't get another 
30,000 today, the Emperor will—

05:04.070 --> 05:07.290
So you're ripping off kids 
from our school now?

05:07.290 --> 05:10.070
You've got some balls.

05:11.260 --> 05:13.580
The guys who shook me down!

05:15.090 --> 05:16.600
Shook you down?

05:16.600 --> 05:19.340
Why the hell are the NG Boys here?

05:20.110 --> 05:23.070
I heard the guy who was exiled 
from Minato, Shindo Akutaro,

05:23.070 --> 05:25.290
just took over as their head.

05:29.480 --> 05:31.850
Those things could get someone killed!

05:31.850 --> 05:33.850
We don't have a choice.

05:34.170 --> 05:37.270
If we don't do it, the Emperor will do <i>us</i>!

05:45.810 --> 05:47.990
Give Shindo a message for me:

05:48.720 --> 05:51.790
Don't get too carried away, son.

05:52.100 --> 05:53.680
I-Insane.

05:53.680 --> 05:56.270
He really is stronk!

05:56.270 --> 05:59.510
Yeah, for Marito-kun,
that wasn't even a warm-up.

06:00.620 --> 06:02.840
Don't need this, either.

06:03.160 --> 06:05.040
All done!

06:07.010 --> 06:11.200
The NG guys never used to 
hassle people around here.

06:11.200 --> 06:14.660
Si-Si-Siguma's the strongest bunch!

06:14.660 --> 06:15.460
A-heave-ho!

06:15.460 --> 06:16.440
We got 'em...

06:17.900 --> 06:19.440
Hey, Big Brother?

06:19.440 --> 06:23.680
I'm heading to Hama Bay. If you're 
done there, wanna come with?

06:23.680 --> 06:26.700
Really? Then let's meet at the café.

06:27.210 --> 06:29.590
<i>Your message has been recorded.</i>

06:39.960 --> 06:41.530
Do you have a minute?

06:44.930 --> 06:46.720
I need to talk to you.

06:47.170 --> 06:50.470
You're the one who got 
Ara-chan into Siguma, right?

06:53.790 --> 06:54.920
Hey, wait!

06:55.350 --> 06:57.810
Ow! What do you think you're doing?

06:58.810 --> 07:01.000
I'm sorry. But...

07:01.500 --> 07:04.630
I'm not letting go until you talk to me.

07:07.430 --> 07:08.700
Let me go.

07:08.700 --> 07:09.920
What?

07:09.920 --> 07:13.380
I said get your dirty hands the hell off me.

07:14.270 --> 07:16.620
Could you speak up a little?

07:22.950 --> 07:24.980
You're gross! Blockhead!

07:28.430 --> 07:31.930
<b>WELLEWCUM</b>

07:30.280 --> 07:32.250
This guy just joined Siguma.

07:31.930 --> 07:35.680
<b>WELLEWCUM</b>

07:31.930 --> 07:35.680
Nice           You            Beat            To

07:32.250 --> 07:34.090
It's Ara-teen!

07:34.090 --> 07:36.070
P-Pleased to meet you!

07:36.070 --> 07:40.440
Just so you know, Ara-teen's 
got a really sick punch.

07:43.210 --> 07:44.530
He's cute.

07:44.530 --> 07:46.780
Look, they're all hot for you!

07:46.780 --> 07:49.850
Shut up! And where are the girls?

07:49.850 --> 07:53.040
Now, for our welcoming party tradition,

07:53.040 --> 07:55.500
let's play Look That-a-Way!

07:55.500 --> 07:57.120
Yeah!

07:57.120 --> 07:59.800
<i>You guys all school kids or something?</i>

07:59.800 --> 08:01.780
<i>I hope the girls show up soon!</i>

08:01.780 --> 08:06.980
The winner will get a one-year 
supply of Maji Kebabs!

08:04.710 --> 08:07.380
<i>Honki</i>

08:10.390 --> 08:13.100
Okay, Ara-teen and I are the seeds.

08:13.460 --> 08:15.210
Partner up with the guy next to you.

08:15.210 --> 08:16.340
Let's do this!

08:16.340 --> 08:17.350
Come on!

08:17.350 --> 08:18.430
I'm ready!

08:18.430 --> 08:19.670
Nice, nice!

08:19.670 --> 08:21.210
Here we go!

08:21.480 --> 08:23.980
Jan-ken-pon!

08:24.340 --> 08:26.770
Turn that-a-way!

08:28.780 --> 08:30.820
Huh?!

08:28.780 --> 08:30.820
Yeah!!

08:33.780 --> 08:35.230
Now I get it!

08:33.780 --> 08:36.620
<b>Debauchery</b>

08:35.230 --> 08:39.100
It isn't "debauchery," it's "de punchery"!

08:36.620 --> 08:40.420
<b>De Punchery</b>

08:40.420 --> 08:43.920
Okay, those of you who turned can sit.

08:44.240 --> 08:45.880
You get the rules now?

08:45.880 --> 08:48.310
It's just like normal "turn that-a-way."

08:48.310 --> 08:51.060
It looks totally different, though!

08:51.640 --> 08:54.160
You just can't turn your head.

08:54.160 --> 08:56.140
Simple, right?

08:57.350 --> 08:59.750
V-Very simple, yes.

08:59.750 --> 09:01.560
Okay, next round!

09:01.850 --> 09:04.550
Jan-ken-pon!

09:04.550 --> 09:07.690
Turn that-a-way!

09:08.280 --> 09:09.950
Turn that-a...

09:09.950 --> 09:11.410
Way!

09:11.410 --> 09:12.910
Turn that-a...

09:12.910 --> 09:14.240
Way!

09:14.240 --> 09:16.120
Turn that-a...

09:16.120 --> 09:17.820
Way!

09:23.150 --> 09:25.660
Ready to give it a shot, Ara-teen?

09:26.250 --> 09:29.210
Oh, no, no! I'm happy to just observe!

09:30.330 --> 09:31.930
There you go again.

09:31.930 --> 09:35.600
Don't you want to show off 
that sick punch of yours?

09:36.040 --> 09:39.440
Heave-ho, showoff! Bucchigiri!

09:39.980 --> 09:43.100
I'll catch you in the final round.

09:43.100 --> 09:44.860
Hey! Let's merge!

09:44.860 --> 09:45.320
Huh?

09:45.320 --> 09:47.040
Come on, hurry up!

09:48.220 --> 09:52.030
I wanna do it with you. 
I really wanna do it.

09:53.130 --> 09:56.560
But y'know, if you win thanks to my help,

09:56.560 --> 09:58.080
will you still be satisfied?

09:58.080 --> 10:00.830
That isn't the problem here!

10:00.830 --> 10:03.590
I finally get my shot at you.

10:05.040 --> 10:06.650
I'm going first.

10:06.650 --> 10:08.130
Of course.

10:08.130 --> 10:10.140
Aw, come on.

10:11.590 --> 10:14.590
I'm Tahide Outa. Good to meet you.

10:15.090 --> 10:18.260
Outa-kun first? The leader 
of the Special Attack Unit?

10:18.260 --> 10:20.100
That kid sure is unlucky.

10:20.420 --> 10:22.430
<i>Is this the end of me?</i>

10:22.430 --> 10:25.730
<i>I never should have joined Siguma!</i>

10:26.050 --> 10:28.690
I don't wanna! I'm gonna die!

10:29.000 --> 10:30.630
Help me!

10:32.030 --> 10:33.470
All right, then.

10:33.470 --> 10:34.990
You mean it, right?

10:35.480 --> 10:37.220
What are you mumbling about?

10:37.220 --> 10:40.120
N-Nothing. A pleasure.

10:40.120 --> 10:43.710
I, Hagure Tatsuto, will serve as referee.

10:44.180 --> 10:48.040
<i>If I don't win at janken, I'll be killed!</i>

10:49.210 --> 10:51.340
The semi-semifinal round.

10:52.070 --> 10:54.170
Players, face off.

10:56.590 --> 10:57.090
Fight!

10:57.090 --> 10:59.350
Jan-ken-pon!

10:59.350 --> 11:01.850
Now break the tie!

11:03.830 --> 11:05.270
I'm counting on you, Senya!

11:05.270 --> 11:07.100
Let's-a heave-ho!

11:07.100 --> 11:09.980
Turn that-a...

11:09.980 --> 11:12.360
No! I can't, I can't, I can't do it!

11:13.030 --> 11:15.090
Bring it on!

11:20.140 --> 11:22.850
Wh-What kind of skull has he got?!

11:22.850 --> 11:26.580
This is the first time anyone other than 
Marito-kun has taken Outa-kun's punch!

11:26.580 --> 11:29.440
No wonder Marito-kun vouched for him!

11:30.610 --> 11:35.160
The force of Tahide Outa's punch 
can even smash concrete!

11:35.590 --> 11:40.150
But Tomoshibi Arajin's skull 
is strong enough to take that?!

11:40.800 --> 11:43.350
Winner: Tomoshibi Arajin!

11:43.350 --> 11:46.600
Heave-ho, here we go! Bucchigiri!

11:46.600 --> 11:49.730
As expected, Ara-teen! So cool!

11:50.230 --> 11:52.330
But what a letdown, Outa.

11:52.330 --> 11:53.410
Shut up.

11:53.410 --> 11:54.480
Outa-kun?

11:55.420 --> 11:56.790
Toilet.

12:01.990 --> 12:05.400
I've been waiting for this chance.

12:06.120 --> 12:10.250
I can't take it! My skull can't take it!

12:10.250 --> 12:12.350
Semifinal round.

12:14.160 --> 12:17.340
Players, face off.

12:19.470 --> 12:20.810
Fight!

12:20.810 --> 12:23.140
Jan-ken-pon!

12:23.140 --> 12:25.350
Shit!

12:25.350 --> 12:27.230
All right!

12:27.710 --> 12:30.440
<i>I'll throw a light punch so I lose.</i>

12:30.820 --> 12:32.560
Turn that-a...

12:33.620 --> 12:35.790
<i>This kid's punch is a joke!</i>

12:37.610 --> 12:41.350
<i>Wh-What... is with this kid?</i>

12:41.820 --> 12:45.080
<i>What the hell is he looking at?</i>

12:45.990 --> 12:47.060
I'm like, seriously?

12:47.060 --> 12:48.370
Oh my God.

12:50.270 --> 12:51.100
Huh?

12:51.630 --> 12:53.350
Th-That technique is

12:53.350 --> 12:56.630
one of the Seven Deadly Blows 
passed down from Cangzhou in China!

12:57.730 --> 12:59.720
Wu Long Pan Da!

12:57.730 --> 13:01.130
<b>Pan Da</b>

12:57.730 --> 13:01.130
<b>Wu Long</b>

13:01.130 --> 13:05.840
When you release all the energy in your body,
 the attack uses centrifugal force

13:05.840 --> 13:08.390
to strike sharply with all of 
the momentum of a heavy whip!

13:08.390 --> 13:10.520
Winner: Tomoshibi Arajin!

13:13.410 --> 13:15.350
Nice one, Ara-teen!

13:19.090 --> 13:21.570
I got so tired of waiting!

13:21.570 --> 13:25.340
The supreme leader arrives! 
Let's-a heave-ho!

13:25.340 --> 13:26.200
Shut up!

13:26.200 --> 13:27.260
What?

13:27.260 --> 13:28.910
No, I didn't mean you!

13:29.190 --> 13:34.540
I don't think anyone has ever 
told me to shut up before.

13:36.670 --> 13:38.040
Players, step forward.

13:41.110 --> 13:43.680
<i>I'm dead. I'm totally dead.</i>

13:44.350 --> 13:47.320
He's gonna crush my skull!

13:47.320 --> 13:49.260
Show him what you're made of!

13:49.260 --> 13:51.000
Don't cower inside your feelings!

13:52.060 --> 13:53.620
Final round.

13:53.620 --> 13:55.720
Players, face off.

13:57.440 --> 14:00.650
The reason I like you, Ara-teen,

14:01.540 --> 14:04.950
is because I could really feel it then.

14:05.590 --> 14:08.260
I felt your Honki!

14:10.410 --> 14:11.450
Fight!

14:12.060 --> 14:13.710
Jan...

14:14.120 --> 14:15.950
ken...

14:22.550 --> 14:23.720
Break, break!

14:23.720 --> 14:24.970
Toilet!

14:25.680 --> 14:27.850
It's gonna blow!

14:35.550 --> 14:36.540
Outa-kun!

14:36.540 --> 14:37.900
Outa-kun!

14:41.030 --> 14:42.570
Isn't the car here yet?

14:42.570 --> 14:44.030
We're calling one now!

14:44.030 --> 14:47.410
Who did this?! Show your damn face!

14:47.410 --> 14:50.040
<b>Minato Kai</b>

14:47.800 --> 14:50.040
Marito-kun, they found this next to him.

14:50.040 --> 14:51.600
That's from Minato!

14:51.600 --> 14:53.650
Let's raid them, Marito-kun!

14:54.420 --> 14:58.500
This kind of shit tactic 
isn't Kenichiro's style.

14:58.500 --> 15:01.300
But we know somebody from Minato did i—

15:01.760 --> 15:05.720
You're saying one of those 
randos did this to Outa?

15:06.200 --> 15:07.600
Huh?

15:09.020 --> 15:10.400
Apologies.

15:13.760 --> 15:17.000
I'm not really seeing the whole picture here.

15:18.180 --> 15:22.150
After Marito-kun and Outa-kun 
met in middle school,

15:22.150 --> 15:25.440
they started calling themselves the 
God Kings and always fought side-by-side.

15:25.440 --> 15:26.720
They're war buddies.

15:27.660 --> 15:31.640
The only person in Honki City 
who can defeat Outa-kun is Doman.

15:32.110 --> 15:37.330
But Marito-kun knows better than anyone that 
Doman wouldn't pull shady stuff like that.

15:37.330 --> 15:43.840
<b>Honki City Station</b>

15:37.330 --> 15:43.840
<b>To Isesaki City</b>

15:37.330 --> 15:43.840
<b>Honnoge</b>

15:38.320 --> 15:40.690
So does he avenge his comrade,

15:40.690 --> 15:43.840
or does he trust his 
arch rival to act like a man?

15:44.310 --> 15:46.820
Sounds like a pretty tight friendship.

15:46.820 --> 15:48.000
Right?

15:48.000 --> 15:49.300
Who cares?

15:54.520 --> 15:57.110
Ugh, my skull hurts.

15:57.110 --> 15:58.220
Arajin-kun.

15:58.770 --> 16:00.710
M-Mahoro-chan?

16:02.270 --> 16:03.330
Why?

16:04.230 --> 16:07.390
Thanks for joining Siguma for me.

16:11.990 --> 16:13.090
What's wrong?

16:13.090 --> 16:14.850
Weren't you just at your welcoming party?

16:15.710 --> 16:17.500
Yeah, well...

16:17.500 --> 16:21.250
My head got smacked real bad,

16:21.250 --> 16:23.860
and nobody warned me about that,

16:24.250 --> 16:28.760
so I'm thinking maybe I should 
quit Siguma, you know?

16:33.470 --> 16:35.600
Things haven't even gotten started yet.

16:36.610 --> 16:41.110
I'm sure my brother is going to ask you 
to take over for him in Siguma.

16:42.300 --> 16:43.960
Please, Arajin-kun,

16:44.320 --> 16:47.110
do it for me. Defeat my brother!

16:47.110 --> 16:48.180
Huh?

16:51.590 --> 16:52.990
Pow.

16:55.110 --> 16:57.870
What's up? Something happen?

16:57.870 --> 17:01.180
Yeah! I'm goin' for it!

16:57.870 --> 17:02.830
<b></b>Chu~ Chu~ 
Chinese Restaurant

17:01.180 --> 17:04.520
How far did you get with that girl? 
Did you kiss her? Hey!

17:06.980 --> 17:09.200
<i>Good chance that guy will fall in line.</i>

17:09.200 --> 17:12.090
<i>Then, when Big Brother graduates from Siguma,</i>

17:12.090 --> 17:14.950
<i>I'll have him all to myself!</i>

17:23.700 --> 17:25.460
Whatcha doin' now?

17:26.470 --> 17:27.790
So how can we...

17:28.520 --> 17:29.400
get our...

17:30.280 --> 17:31.460
merge rate up?

17:31.910 --> 17:35.890
Wh-What was that? What did you just say?

17:36.580 --> 17:40.320
I've got to become Marito-san's successor.

17:40.320 --> 17:41.530
So it looks like

17:42.370 --> 17:44.420
we gotta merge, one way or another.

17:44.760 --> 17:48.780
You're turning into such a fine man!

17:49.870 --> 17:51.810
This makes me so happy!

17:51.810 --> 17:53.760
<i>Merge? With that girl?</i>

18:08.830 --> 18:12.990
Is this really improving our merge rate?

18:13.260 --> 18:15.740
The important thing is that we harmonize.

18:15.740 --> 18:17.920
Come on, one more time.

18:19.470 --> 18:21.920
What the hell do you mean, "harmonize"?

18:24.260 --> 18:27.670
Why do you even want to 
merge in the first place?

18:27.670 --> 18:29.920
Th-That's what I've been telling you!

18:30.340 --> 18:32.910
Men have a natural instinct to merge.

18:33.590 --> 18:37.360
Oh, that's right. Let's do it, Senya.

18:37.360 --> 18:38.390
Oh, yeah!

18:43.690 --> 18:45.160
Hilarious!

18:46.070 --> 18:48.190
What do you think you're looking at? Huh?

18:48.600 --> 18:51.850
Let's go, Ryu-chan. 
It'll be trouble if we take them now.

18:52.860 --> 18:55.230
First-years from Siguma, huh?

18:55.230 --> 18:58.660
You just gonna run away, you spineless punks?

18:59.910 --> 19:01.710
Wait! Ryu-chan!

19:02.240 --> 19:04.100
Who the hell is running?

19:04.100 --> 19:05.920
You are! Huh?!

19:05.920 --> 19:08.450
After you ambushed Outa-kun!

19:08.450 --> 19:10.730
Huh? What are you talking—

19:09.330 --> 19:12.060
Quit acting dumb!

19:12.720 --> 19:13.680
Ryu-chan!

19:14.260 --> 19:16.090
Ryu-chan, let's go!

19:16.090 --> 19:18.120
This ain't over yet!

19:18.120 --> 19:20.810
I swear I'll get vengeance for Outa-kun!

19:23.770 --> 19:25.770
That asshole.

19:40.040 --> 19:43.840
The pitcher winds up 
and throws the first ball!

19:44.950 --> 19:47.460
Sup... sock... zam!

19:48.630 --> 19:51.140
The pitcher killer!

19:51.140 --> 19:53.980
Okay, find a partner and stretch.

19:53.980 --> 19:55.380
Huh? Uh...

19:55.870 --> 19:56.710
Let's pair up.

19:56.710 --> 19:58.380
Yeah... Huh?!

20:00.760 --> 20:03.140
It's been a while, right?

20:04.470 --> 20:05.820
What has?

20:05.820 --> 20:09.150
We always used to be partners 
in elementary school.

20:11.710 --> 20:13.400
I don't even remember.

20:15.780 --> 20:17.790
Switch sides.

20:21.990 --> 20:23.070
You good?

20:23.070 --> 20:26.090
Of... course I am!

20:27.260 --> 20:29.010
What did Jin-san say to you?

20:29.010 --> 20:31.910
Y-You're asking that now?

20:31.910 --> 20:35.530
Even if she asked you to, 
there's no reason to join Siguma.

20:36.800 --> 20:42.680
Sh-She said... I have to... 
become Marito-san's successor!

20:45.560 --> 20:46.810
Ara-chan?

20:46.810 --> 20:49.810
Matakara! Siguma got Shitate and Amichi!

20:56.260 --> 21:00.080
Damn it! They tied them 
up tight in these fundoshi!

21:00.080 --> 21:03.070
Nobody but Siguma would put 
them in something like that.

21:03.530 --> 21:05.450
They won't get away with this!

21:12.610 --> 21:13.720
Minato?!

21:15.880 --> 21:17.380
What the hell are you doing?

21:17.380 --> 21:20.130
You're the ones who started this!

21:20.130 --> 21:21.290
Eat this!

21:22.300 --> 21:23.050
Yeah?

21:23.050 --> 21:24.470
You piece of shit!

21:24.470 --> 21:25.140
Hah?

21:27.350 --> 21:29.180
Those Minato scum.

21:29.610 --> 21:31.580
I can't take this anymore.

21:36.690 --> 21:39.190
<i><b>You're next</b></i>

21:36.690 --> 21:39.190
<i><b>Dead</b></i>

21:42.950 --> 21:45.700
<b>Mi</b>

21:42.950 --> 21:45.700
We at least got them to a hospital.

21:46.110 --> 21:48.020
They had broken ribs.

21:48.020 --> 21:51.060
And they were completely humiliated.

21:51.460 --> 21:54.460
<b>Ocean</b>

21:51.460 --> 21:54.460
<b>Truth</b>

21:51.460 --> 21:54.460
<b>Spirit</b>

21:51.460 --> 21:54.460
<b>Sincerity</b>

21:56.130 --> 21:57.850
What the hell are you doing?

21:57.850 --> 21:59.710
What business do you have here?

22:00.100 --> 22:02.620
I've got a debt to repay.

22:03.340 --> 22:05.850
Show your face, Kenichiro!

23:45.030 --> 23:50.030
<b>Stop the War!</b>

23:45.030 --> 23:50.030
<b>Sometimes You Gotta Eat Goya Chanpuru</b>

23:45.350 --> 23:48.120
Bucchigi-you again next week!
